  regionalLoot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89ed79d7f74c8a0418f6d179f7291dd1, type: 2}
  eliteLoot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0a66653fb034ad84989592eb5e75a272, type: 2}
  durationSeconds: 720
  extractionSeconds: 30
  lootMultiplier: 1
  enemyHealthMultiplier: 1
  enemyPowerMultiplier: 1
  difficulties:
  - tier: 2
    recommendedGearScore: 30
    minimumGearScore: 15
    wardLevelNeeded: 1
    enemyHealth: 1.4
    enemyPower: 1.6
    enemyDensity: 1.15
    loot: 1.25
    dropsUpToTier: 0
    briefing: Runts and the tusse rob the bridges; small trolls and the trollkjerring hold the lairs. Iron lies in the scree, and the seters still hold what the dairymaids left.
    eliteCount: {x: 1, y: 2}
    eliteAffixes: 1
    hunterEliteChance: 0
    eliteRelicChance: 0.05
    eliteLoot:
      entries: []
  - tier: 3
    recommendedGearScore: 50
    minimumGearScore: 30
    wardLevelNeeded: 2
    enemyHealth: 2.3
    enemyPower: 2.85
    enemyDensity: 1.3
    loot: 1.5
    dropsUpToTier: 0
    briefing: 'Stone trolls stand on the bridges and the hoards hold moonsilver. Some of the stones on the slopes are not stones. Past the valley''s head the Brukam sits on his own bridge: the portal knows the way.'
    eliteCount: {x: 2, y: 3}
    eliteAffixes: 1
    hunterEliteChance: 0.15
    eliteRelicChance: 0.1
    eliteLoot:
      entries: []
  - tier: 4
    recommendedGearScore: 70
    minimumGearScore: 45
    wardLevelNeeded: 3
    enemyHealth: 2.8
    enemyPower: 4.05
    enemyDensity: 1.45
    loot: 1.8
    dropsUpToTier: 0
    briefing: The trolls gather at the ting by night and a berg-jutul walks the valley. The hoards hold Trollstone, and so do the elites.
    eliteCount: {x: 3, y: 4}
    eliteAffixes: 2
    hunterEliteChance: 0.25
    eliteRelicChance: 0.15
    eliteLoot:
      entries: []
  eliteAffixes:
