  timesOfDay:
  - name: Dawn
    hour: 6.6
    chance: 15
    lootMultiplier: 1.05
    enemyDensity: 0.85
    briefing: First light on the river. The trolls are slow to wake, and some of them are still stone.
    skyCover: 0.25
  - name: Day
    hour: 11
    chance: 60
    lootMultiplier: 1
    enemyDensity: 1
    briefing: Clear cold air down the valley. You can see a long way, and so can they.
    skyCover: 0.25
  - name: Dusk
    hour: 19.2
    chance: 15
    lootMultiplier: 1.15
    enemyDensity: 1.15
    briefing: The sun drops behind the valley wall early. The stones on the slopes start to look like they are watching.
    skyCover: 0.25
  - name: Night
    hour: 23.5
    chance: 10
    lootMultiplier: 1.4
    enemyDensity: 1.3
    briefing: 'The trolls walk at night: more of them, and stronger. They see no better than you, but they hear as well as ever. They carry twice the Cursed Essence.'
    skyCover: 0.2
